      "verified_live": true,
      "confirms": [
        "Old-method retirement moved to 2026-10-19.",
        "Products and candidates use Money, limit <= 100 and last_id.",
        "V2 deactivate is for voucher promotions only, with root product_ids in the response.",
        "Boosting exit uses products/update with action_price strictly greater than the threshold.",
        "Auto-add uses offset/limit and action_id, auto_add_date, product_ids (at most 1000).",
        "The article calls the future-list manual flag is_manually_added."
      ]
    },
